ontent":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"We know plans can change. Here’s how refunds work for paid Read in the Park events:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"bullet_list","content":[{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Full refunds are available up to 72 hours before the event.","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Within ","type":"text"},{"text":"72 hours of the event","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":", tickets are generally non-refundable because we may already have committed to venue, materials, food, or other event costs.","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"If you can no longer attend, you’re welcome to ","type":"text"},{"text":"transfer your ticket to someone else","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":". Please send us their name before the event so we can update our check-in list.","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"If ","type":"text"},{"text":"Read in the Park cancels the event","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":", you’ll receive a full refund.","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"For outdoor events, light rain, wind, cold, or other normal weather changes may result in adjustments to the event rather than cancellation. If weather or safety conditions require us to cancel, we’ll contact registered attendees and issue a refund.","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Refunds may take a few business days to appear depending on the payment provider.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"If you have an unusual circumstance, feel free to reach out. We’ll always try to be reasonable where we can.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Contact: ","type":"tex